| # | Step | Task | Fidelity | Script |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| 010 | Report matrix leg | \`CmdLine@2\` | \`exact\` | [\`010-report-matrix-leg.sh\`](stages/010-default/jobs/010-build__linux-debug/steps/010-report-matrix-leg.sh) |
| 020 | Produce output | \`CmdLine@2\` | \`exact\` | [\`020-produce-output.sh\`](stages/010-default/jobs/010-build__linux-debug/steps/020-produce-output.sh) |
