"# Converted Azure DevOps pipeline

A local, dependency-free bash rendering of an Azure DevOps pipeline, generated by \`azdo-emu\`.
Every stage, job and step below is a script you can read, edit, and run on its own.

- **Structure:** 1 stage, 2 jobs, 8 step scripts.
- **Expansion:** **service** — expanded by Azure DevOps (pipeline \`42\`, api-version \`7.1-preview.1\`, fresh).
- **Gaps:** 1 entry in [Warnings](#warnings); 0 unsupported constructs.

